# EC-008: Iron oxidation state determines whether iodide is oxidised
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v1 FeCl3 0.0004mol
add v1 KI 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v2 FeSO4 0.0004mol
add v2 KI 0.001mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
